WEBVTT

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:12.830
Why didn't you say something sooner?

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:15.610
I didn't think it was this bad.

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:20.000
I don't suppose we could
 just keep this quiet...

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.200
You know we can't do that.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:22.260
B-But...

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:24.490
The coach will be at the venue.

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:26.080
He'll know right away.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:28.000
We have to tell them.

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:36.260
Why did this have to happen 
on such an important day?

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:07.980
<b><i>Backflip!!</i></b>

00:02:08.990 --> 00:02:12.260
A sprain's not that big a deal, right?

00:02:12.260 --> 00:02:16.060
Don't underestimate a sprain. 
There can be serious consequences.

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:18.000
We need to figure out 
if he can even perform—

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:18.900
I'll do it!

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:20.430
I'll be fine.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:23.840
You'd better see the doctor first.

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:25.500
Really, I'm fine!

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:28.060
Then get the doctor to verify it.

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:30.080
You might miss the opening ceremony,

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:31.710
but you'll make it in time to compete.

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:35.200
I can't let you perform 
unless you go see a doctor.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:37.640
All right.

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:39.560
I'll go with him.

00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:40.590
Please do.

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.350
51st Tohoku High School

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.350
<b>Rhythmic Gymnastics Tournament</b>

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.350
<b>Welcome to Kesennuma City!</b>

00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:01.320
How's Futaba-kun looking?

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:07.620
Hey!

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:09.710
Takase...

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:11.750
You finally made it, eh,

00:03:12.130 --> 00:03:13.670
sasakama sucker?

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:15.920
Yeah.

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:16.620
Huh?

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:18.080
What's the matter?

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:19.580
Don't tell me you're nervous.

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:21.840
Hey! Where are Misa-pon and Shotaro?

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:25.310
Can you believe it? They overslept!

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:28.300
Man, those first-years of ours...

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:28.650
Misa-pon overslept?

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:29.750
Let's go.

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:31.600
See you!

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.110
I believe something's amiss.

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:37.940
Oh! Your nephew's competing, too?

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:40.000
Yes! He's on the Ao High team.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.320
What grade is he in?!

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:42.220
He's a first-year.

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:44.950
<i>We will now begin the opening ceremony.</i>

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:44.950
Hey, just like Shotaro!

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:47.620
Could you mean Shotaro Futaba?

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:54.880
Huh?

00:03:54.000 --> 00:04:00.130
<i>We expect each of you to compete
with all your hearts,</i>

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:56.460
Shotaro's not there...

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:57.770
Neither is Ryo-chan.

00:03:57.770 --> 00:03:58.920
Think they're running late?

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:00.130
Should we call?

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:03.510
Don't worry. He'd call 
if something were wrong.

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:04.280
<i>full of youthful energy.</i>

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:04.860
Okay!

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:11.180
Competing first: Akita Higashi High School, 
representing Akita Prefecture.

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:12.180
Ready!

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:19.720
Sitting around won't do us any good.

00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:21.090
Focus. Focus.

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:22.320
Y-Yes, sir!

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:22.320
Yah!

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:29.090
<i>Performing second: Sukagawa Third High School, 
representing Fukushima Prefecture.</i>

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.490
Warm-Up Area
Authorized Personnel Only

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:31.300
You got a sec, Komatsu-san?

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:32.750
Oh, sure!

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:41.590
<b>51st Tohoku High School Rhythmic Gymnastics Tournament</b>

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:41.590
<b>Sukagawa Third</b>

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:41.590
<b>Akita Higashi</b>

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:48.620
Let's go.

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:06.380
Someone's havin' a hard time.

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:09.410
Your two first-years 
still appear to be missing.

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:12.900
I knew Misa-pon and Shotaro weren't coming...

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:14.640
Easy win. Boring.

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:17.270
Tsukiyuki! Don't let your guard down!

00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:21.900
You've improved somewhat, 
but four of you are no competition for us.

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:26.660
It appears we may have overestimated you.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:38.930
Two years ago,

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:41.910
you only had three guys.

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:47.280
But you <i>always</i> held your heads high, 
eyes glinting at the thought of a challenge!

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:53.610
And last year, with only the four of you, 
you competed your absolute hardest.

00:05:53.610 --> 00:05:57.340
But look at you now.

00:05:57.340 --> 00:05:58.580
It's pathetic.

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:01.170
It's not even worth it to kick your asses!

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.590
Oh, shut up.

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:08.680
We're the same as we ever were!

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:26.580
We might have ourselves a bit of competition.

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:27.610
You think?

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:31.520
Show your elders some respect!

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:30.350
They really let us have it.

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:33.560
Yeah. And they were right.

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:36.870
All right! Let's soar like we wanna win,
 just like always!

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:38.460
Yeah!

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:47.740
<i>Performing fourth: Hakumei University Private
High School, representing Aomori Prefecture.</i>

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:50.470
They're the guys who won 
last year's Inter-High!

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:51.440
Ready!

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:53.610
They're even better than they 
were at the training camp.

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:55.410
I expected this much from Takase and Mutsu,

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:57.590
but the others ain't bad either.

00:08:57.590 --> 00:09:00.020
And that Mashiro Tsukiyuki...

00:09:00.020 --> 00:09:02.750
Is he some kind of monster?

00:09:23.270 --> 00:09:25.200
Compared to the other schools...

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:27.040
Yeah, they're way better.

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:28.720
Flawless so far.

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:31.250
Just what I'd expect from Mabuchi-senpai.

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:35.230
<b>51st Tohoku High School Rhythmic Gymnastics Tournament</b>

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:35.300
<b>Hakumei University Private High School</b>

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:37.070
<b>51st Tohoku High School Rhythmic Gymnastics Tournament</b>

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:37.070
<b>Hakumei University Private High School</b>

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:37.070
<b>Score</b>

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:38.740
Eighteen points!

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:38.740
They're in first!

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:44.190
Eighteen points even.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:46.880
Straight to the top of the board.

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:49.000
It'll make it all the more 
satisfyin' to beat 'em.

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:53.030
<i>We will now take a forty-minute break.</i>

00:10:53.030 --> 00:10:56.350
<i>The competition will resume 
at one o'clock sharp.</i>

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:56.740
Okay! Let's run through 
the routine one more—

00:10:56.740 --> 00:10:57.740
Captain.

00:10:56.740 --> 00:10:58.130
<i>I repeat.</i>

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:02.010
<i>We will now take a forty-minute break.</i>

00:11:02.450 --> 00:11:04.140
Have some rolled omelet, Sakiko-san!

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:06.430
Say, "Ah!"

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:07.060
Ah!

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:09.260
Hey, that's good!

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:10.350
I wonder if Sho-chan's made it here yet.

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:13.320
I'll perform.

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:16.840
Hang on... They said you need 
two weeks' rest, right?

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:19.280
If I sit out, it's a 1.5-point penalty.

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:21.910
This competition is too close
 for you to win with that.

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:24.950
It'll be just as bad if you 
screw up the whole thing!

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:26.200
I won't screw it up!

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:30.790
The pain's mostly abated. 
I can bear it for three minutes—

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:33.440
And what if performin' makes it worse?!

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:43.060
Shotaro...

00:11:43.670 --> 00:11:47.180
You still have next year. 
You shouldn't force your—

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:48.950
I <i>don't</i> have next year!

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:51.310
Shotaro...

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:53.310
This is...

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:57.300
This is the only year the six 
of us have to perform together.

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:00.310
If we lose today...

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:02.740
then it's all over.

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:07.000
This is the last chance that we,
Shichigahama-senpai, Tsukidate-senpai,

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:10.360
Onagawa-senpai, Watari-senpai,

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:12.110
Misato-kun, and I...

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:16.270
The last time we can all compete together.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:21.400
And I just...

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:23.300
I just...

00:12:23.980 --> 00:12:27.600
You guys taught me how to soar.

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:30.390
The whole Ao High men's 
rhythmic gymnastics team.

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:34.560
And I want to soar with all of you!

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:38.170
Please let me compete!

00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:40.960
Please!

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:45.260
I...

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:50.800
I'd rather try to win with six 
than lose with five.

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:52.000
Please!

00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:01.420
Shotaro...

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:05.830
As captain, there's no way 
I can let you go out there.

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:09.600
At least, that's what I want to say.

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:10.810
Shichigahama!

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:11.940
Do you realize what you're saying?!

00:13:11.940 --> 00:13:15.490
Haven't we been working for 
three years to reach the Inter-High?

00:13:15.490 --> 00:13:19.190
Of course! But we don't have to drag 
Shotaro along for our dream—

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:21.360
It's not just our dream anymore!

00:13:21.990 --> 00:13:25.360
Shotaro and Misato share the same dream now.

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:28.110
Could any of you take it?

00:13:28.110 --> 00:13:32.590
Could you stomach being left out
if you were in Shotaro's place?

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:34.580
I know I never could.

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:39.620
Even if I broke my damned arm... 
I'd feel the same way.

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:44.710
Not much of a captain, am I?

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:47.060
Shichigahama...

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:56.510
I know it's a big ask,

00:13:56.510 --> 00:13:59.520
but I'm with Shotaro on this one.

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:04.340
I... I want to perform with six as well.

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:07.370
There's not much point 
if we can't all soar together.

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:10.750
I'll keep a close eye on Shotaro 
during the performance.

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:11.780
So...

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:13.290
Please!

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:32.550
You might never be able 
to do gymnastics again.

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:36.480
I know.

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:40.350
You might get through today 
and knock yourself out of the Inter-High.

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.230
I know.

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:45.650
If anything goes wrong, 
it reflects back on the team.

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:47.290
I'll take responsibility!

00:14:47.290 --> 00:14:49.220
It's not that simple.

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:53.550
Once something goes wrong, 
nobody can take responsibility.

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:09.190
No warming up with this arm.

00:15:09.190 --> 00:15:11.720
Stay off it until competition time.

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:15.970
And the second the performance is over, 
you're going back to the hospital.

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:17.740
Coach!

00:15:18.170 --> 00:15:22.300
And you're going sooner
 if it gets worse before then.

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:25.240
Yes, sir!

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:28.150
Hell yeah!

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:30.310
It's decided, so let's get a move on!

00:15:30.310 --> 00:15:31.570
Hurry it up!

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:33.550
We're losin' warm-up time!

00:15:33.550 --> 00:15:34.260
Right!

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:37.100
Time to put on our best performance yet!

00:15:35.430 --> 00:15:36.710
Shusaku...

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:38.900
Yeah! Let's do it!

00:15:37.960 --> 00:15:39.820
Guess I'm not much of a coach, either.

00:15:39.820 --> 00:15:40.770
No.

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:45.750
You're the only coach for us!

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:53.280
<i>The afternoon block will now begin.</i>

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:59.740
<i>Performing fifth: Yamagata Shohoku High School, 
representing Yamagata Prefecture.</i>

00:16:03.930 --> 00:16:05.060
Misato-kun.

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:07.700
I'll be fine.

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:10.350
You don't have to stick to me like this.

00:16:15.350 --> 00:16:18.370
You should be needy too, now and again.

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:21.220
Yeah. Thanks.

00:16:36.280 --> 00:16:37.970
Well, shall we?

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:39.070
Yes, sir!

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:39.070
Yah!

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:45.600
It's Shotaro!

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:45.600
Ryo-chan!

00:16:46.010 --> 00:16:47.480
I'm so glad.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:58.180
<b>Sendai Tokuou High School</b>

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:59.610
<b>51st Tohoku High School Rhythmic Gymnastics Tournament</b>

00:17:02.460 --> 00:17:04.570
Shiro High's still in first.

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:05.900
They'd better be!

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:08.380
We're the ones who're gonna take 'em down!

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:09.960
The sky.

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:13.480
Look to the sky, and let's get through this,

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:15.380
soaring higher than ever!

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:16.860
Yeah!

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:19.750
Give it your all.

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:20.560
Right!

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:21.360
Give it your all.

00:17:21.360 --> 00:17:22.080
Right!

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:22.780
Fight hard.

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:23.480
Right!

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:24.170
Fight hard.

00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:24.890
Yah!

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:25.690
Fight hard.

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:26.390
Right!

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:28.620
Give it your all, and have fun!

00:17:28.620 --> 00:17:29.540
Right!

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:39.110
<i>Performing seventh: Soshukan Private High School, 
representing Miyagi Prefecture.</i>

00:17:39.110 --> 00:17:40.030
Ready!
